# Translate contract (do not flip)

Default / Go / Follow / paste / type / lang change = lexicon only (`llm: false`). **LLM** is the only path that sends `llm: true`.

Do **not** reintroduce `scheduleLlm`, `overlayLlm`, `llmTimer`, or status `lex · llm…`. Do not auto-fire Ollama after lex to "fix quality." Do not change this contract unless Randy says so in chat.

```typescript
// BAD
setMtStatus("lex · llm…", "busy");
scheduleLlm(source, from, to, epoch, 350);

// GOOD
setMtStatus("lex", "ok");
```
